{#
  Renders from content/apbc/* (docs/CONTENT_MODEL.md) instead of the legacy
  {% include "tracks/apbc.html" %} — eighth track cut over, following the established pattern
  (docs/DECISIONS/0005-qudrat-cutover.md, 0006, 0007). index.html (deleted, WP10 step 4 — docs/DECISIONS/0023; still recoverable via
  git history) and src/_includes/tracks/apbc.html (also deleted, same step) used
  to be kept as an inert rollback path — no longer needed once every track had been
  migrated and verified live.

  Real deviations found in this track (WP19):
  - The rail's practice link reads "Exam practice"/⊘, not the site-wide "Practice set"/§ —
    passed explicitly below via practiceSetLabel/practiceSetIcon (rail.njk).
  - The practice-set uses the STANDARD .ph/.pn/.pq/.lvl markup (like qud/tah/act2/est/est2), but
    each item's visible badge text is "MCQ"/"FRQ" while the underlying difficulty (and its CSS
    color class) is still Basic/Intermediate/Advanced — practiceSet.items[].levelLabel overrides
    the displayed text independently of the class-driving `difficulty` field.
  - testGenerator is fully STANDARD here (unlike appc/apstats) — confirms 'compact' is a real,
    genuine AP-track variant, not something every AP track uses.
  - chapterTag is the 'category' variant (matches apstats, not appc) for the 6 numbered BC-N
    chapters; the overview/beyond/frq chapters have none.
#}
{% set apbc = migratedContent.apbc %}
{% set pageHeader = apbc.meta.meta.pageHeader %}
<main id="view-apbc" class="view active">
  {% include "partials/subject-head.njk" %}

  <div class="wrap calc-body">
    {% set chapters = apbc.chapters %}
    {% set practiceSetId = 'apbc-practice' %}
    {% set practiceSetLabel = apbc.practiceSet.heading %}
    {% set practiceSetIcon = apbc.practiceSet.icon %}
    {% set testGeneratorId = 'apbc-testgen' %}
    {% set downloadsId = 'apbc-downloads' %}
    {% include "partials/rail.njk" %}

    <div class="content">
      {% for chapter in apbc.chapters %}
        {% include "partials/chapter.njk" %}
      {% endfor %}

      {% set sectionId = 'apbc-practice' %}
      {% set practiceSet = apbc.practiceSet %}
      {% include "partials/practice-set.njk" %}

      {% set sectionId = 'apbc-testgen' %}
      {% set testGenerator = apbc.meta.meta.testGenerator %}
      {% include "partials/test-generator.njk" %}

      {% set sectionId = 'apbc-downloads' %}
      {% set courseMeta = apbc.meta.meta %}
      {% include "partials/downloads-block.njk" %}
    </div>
  </div>
</main>
